        "body": "Bumps [c8](https://github.com/bcoe/c8) from 11.0.0 to 12.0.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/bcoe/c8/releases\">c8's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v12.0.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/bcoe/c8/compare/v11.0.0...v12.0.0\">12.0.0</a> (2026-07-14)</h2>\n<h3>⚠ BREAKING CHANGES</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>yargs enforces a stricter range of Node versions ^20.19.0 || ^22.12.0 || &gt;=23</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>update yargs to 18.x.x (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/bcoe/c8/issues/599\">#599</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/bcoe/c8/commit/dc2d6c81e0b82aad80ffcc38d78bd4a76665675e\">dc2d6c8</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/bcoe/c8/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">c8's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/bcoe/c8/compare/v11.0.0...v12.0.0\">12.0.0</a> (2026-07-14)</h2>\n<h3>⚠ BREAKING CHANGES</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>yargs enforces a stricter range of Node versions ^20.19.0 || ^22.12.0 || &gt;=23</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>update yargs to 18.x.x (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/bcoe/c8/issues/599\">#599</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/bcoe/c8/commit/dc2d6c81e0b82aad80ffcc38d78bd4a76665675e\">dc2d6c8</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/bcoe/c8/commit/ae5a0cf4349b92cac910cf7275e724ab7a725b9d\"><code>ae5a0cf</code></a> chore(main): release 12.0.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/bcoe/c8/issues/600\">#600</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/bcoe/c8/commit/dc2d6c81e0b82aad80ffcc38d78bd4a76665675e\"><code>dc2d6c8</code></a> feat!: update yargs to 18.x.x (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/bcoe/c8/issues/599\">#599</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/bcoe/c8/commit/ee2f1cfc5584d41bb2d51b788d0953dab0c798f8\"><code>ee2f1